# DAU — Formüller & Eşikler

## Delta
```
DELTA_THRESHOLD_NOISE  = 0.1  # NO_TRACE
DELTA_THRESHOLD_NORMAL = 0.4  # NORMAL
DELTA_THRESHOLD_DEEP   = 0.7  # DEEP
# üstü: TRAUMA → drift
```

## Memory Score
```
memory_score = 0.3·recency + 0.4·magnitude + 0.3·domain_match
```

## Ebbinghaus
```
t = now_counter - record.last_activated_counter
S = max(1, round(record.magnitude / S_UNIT))  # S_UNIT = 0.1
R = exp(-t / S)
# Recall: S += 1 · Travma silinmez (TRAUMA_S_BASE = 10)
```

## InternalState
- `energy` (setpoint 1.0)
- `resource_load` / `uncertainty_load` / `social_load` (setpoint 0.0)

## Layer 1.5 Prediction Error
```
prediction_error = 1 - keyword_overlap(expected_outcome, actual_outcome)
# tüm eksenler prediction_error ile kayar; energy metabolik taban korur
```

## Layer 2 EmotionalWeight
```
threat  = clamp(magnitude · resource_load, 0, 1)
reward  = clamp((1 − magnitude) · energy, 0, 1)
novelty = clamp(magnitude · uncertainty_load, 0, 1)
social  = clamp(social_load, 0, 1)
loss    = 1.0 if is_trauma else 0.0
```

## Layer 2 Drift
```
trauma → flags[domain]=True; magnitudes[domain] += magnitude
get_drift_bias → flagged magnitude else 0.0
# kalıcı; healing Layer 3
```

